     "name": "Kris Letang",
     "description": "Kris Letang, a gifted skater known for his offensive prowess as a defenseman, has spent his entire career with the Pittsburgh Penguins, contributing to three Stanley Cup championships. In an October 2019 game against the Dallas Stars, Letang showcased his skill by weaving past two defenders and scoring a beautiful third-period goal that gave Pittsburgh their first lead of the game. The Penguins held onto the lead, and Letang later sealed the victory with an empty-net goal for his second of the night.\n\nOfficially Licensed Product of the NHL, NHLPA, and/or NHLAA. All copyright, logos, and marks are the property of their respective owners and are used, under license, by Sweet. All Rights Reserved. [Terms Apply](https://nhlbreakaway.com/terms).",
